## Program Outcome

Tool Shed has a deterministic, low-reasoning, database-heavy qualification harness that exercises
real Idea-to-PRM-to-governed-work lifecycles and proves exact agreement among local authority,
reporter transport, hosted projections, and operator presentation. It detects phantom, missing,
duplicate, stale, unreconciled, orphaned, and falsely closed state; retains bounded replay evidence;
and qualifies one exact candidate across hosted-development, Linux, and Windows before any separate
production promotion.

